# GSF-Ark deferred backlog (Cursor)

SSOT (AdSense **승인 후**): `docs/DEFERRED_AFTER_ADSENSE.md`  
SSOT (Gate **전** §1–4 / 네이버 / Tier1): `docs/s14-sprint/OPEN_QUEUE.md`

On GSF-Ark work:

1. Always read **OPEN_QUEUE** for pre-Gate items; remind Joseph of open P0/P1 (see `gsf-ark-open-queue-remind.mdc`).
2. Read **DEFERRED_AFTER_ADSENSE** for `status: open` post-approval items.
3. Do **not** start P0–P2 bulk content/schema work in DEFERRED while AdSense review is pending, unless Joseph explicitly exempts.
4. When Joseph mentions AdSense approval or “후속 과제”, propose work from DEFERRED in priority order (P0 → P1 → P2).
5. On completing an item: set `status: done` in the owning file, append completion log if any, and `hub:log --author=Cursor`.
6. Owner of both backlogs is **Cursor** (not Claude/AG alone). AG tasks must cite IDs (e.g. `A1`, `N1`, `#1`).
